# Subagent Model Parity

Use this rule when launching subagents for analysis, writing, review, research, or implementation.

Do not silently downgrade to a weaker model when the task depends on high judgment quality.

If the user requested a specific model and it is unavailable, say which model is unavailable and list available choices. Do not substitute without acknowledgement.

If model parity matters and cannot be preserved, do the work in the main agent or narrow the delegated task to a lower-risk bounded investigation.
